    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abomusikalo bakalukha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe khubaayi abo abatibia nibasalaasia amakondi akomubwayilo bwanje! NiIwo olwa OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, asunga khukabaayi abo abaayanga abandu banje; mbu Musalaasiye lituuli lianje, nimuliilusia, nimuralilinda ta. Lole, ndalamukoonya inywe khulwa ebikhole bieenywe ebibii; nilwo olwa OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalakhung'aasia omusikalo kwelituuli lianje okhurula mubialo biosi ewa ndabeelusilia, nimbakalusia mukhonje tsiabwe; mana baleebulana nibeenjiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalaraho abaayi khubo abalabaayanga; shibalaria kata okhufwa omwoyo khandi ta; kata oundi yesi khubo shialabulaho tawe; nilwo olwa OMWAMI aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI aboola mbu Lola, tsindaalo tsiitsanga olwa ndalamurombosilia Daudi Omurombo omulunjishi; naye alaruka, shinga olwa ali omuruchi, nakaasa, nakhola obuyaasii nobukhalachi bwatoto mushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalotsie Yuda alahonibwa, naye Isiraeli alamenya shisale; ne eliiralie elia alalangungwa ndielino, mbu OMWAMI ouli obulunjishi bweefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI aboola mbu Lola, tsindaalo tsiitsanga olwa shibalasunganga khandi mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo owatikulusia abaana baIsiraeli nabarusia mushialo shiaMisiri, ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo, owatikulusia abolwibulo lweinzu yaIsiraeli, nabeemilila injila okhurula mushialo shienotsi nokhurula mubialo biosi ewa yali nabeelusiliye; mana balamenya mushialo shiabwe abeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akokhufukula abanabii bobubeeyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola khumakhuwakabanabii; mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka OMWAMI wamahe aboola; mbu Murahulila amakhuwa kabanabii abamurumbulilanga amakhuwa ta; bamukaasinjia namakhuwa amakhaya; baboola akobunabii bwomumioyo chiabwe abeene, niburarula mumunwa kwOMWAMI ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obushia nobushia baboolelanga abo abaleka likhuwa liOMWAMI, bari Mulaba nomulembe; khandi khubuli mundu owichendelesia mubutinyu bwomwoyokwe, bari Libii shililakhukwila ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI areeba mbu Kho nindi ahambi, endi Nyasaye; ne nindi ehale, shindi Nyasaye ta; noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliho ounyala okhwibisa hamabiswi mbu endeshe okhumulola? Nolwa OMWAMI areeba. Shinzitsulanga mwikulu nomushialo pe? Nolwa OMWAMI areeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahuliile aka abanabii baboolanga, abarumbulilanga akobubeeyi muliira lianje, bari Endoorile, endoorile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kano kalamenya okhuula liina mumioyo chiabanabii abarumbulanga akobubeeyi, nibo abanabii abobubatsa obwomumioyo chiabwe abeene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeenabo beenyanga okhwibilisia abandu banje eliira li mje khulwa amalooro kabwe aka buli mundu atoonyelanga owashie, shinga abakuuka babwe olwa beebilila eliira lianje khulwa Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunabii ouli nende lilooro, atoonye akelilooro; ne oyo ouli nende likhuwa lianje, aboole likhuwa lianje mubwisiikwa. Olububa nishiina khungaano? Nolwa OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa lianje shilifwana shinga omulilo? Nolwa OMWAMI aboola; khandi shinga inyoli eyitubula lichina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI asunga mbu Lola, isie efukula abanabii abo abeebananga amakhuwa kanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI asunga mbu Lola, isie efukula abanabii abo abeekhoonyela tsinimi tsiabwe nibasunga mbu OMWAMI aboolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI asunga mbu Lola, isie embafukula abo abarumbuIanga akamalooro kobubeeyi, nibakatoonya, nibakosia abandu banje nobubeeyi bwabwe, khandi nende obushilaasii bwabwe; nebutswa isie shindabaruma kata okhubalaka ta; akabwe kabula inganga khubandu bano; nolwa OMWAMI aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa omundu owokhubandu bano, kata omunabii, kata omukuhani, aba nakhureeba mbu Omusiiko omusitohu kwOMWAMI nishiina? Kho olakalusia mbu Ninywe omusiiko; ne ndalamulekha; nolwa OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumakhuwa komunabii tsana, nomukuhani, nomundu owokhubandu bano, oulasunga mbu Omusiiko kwOMWAMI, okhukuuma ndalakuuma omundu oyo nabeinzuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka mulasungananga, buli mundu nowashie, nabuli mundu nomwana wabwe, mbu Aka OMWAMI akalusiye kali karie? Kata mbu Aka OMWAMI aboolile kali karie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa omusiiko omusitohu kwOMWAMI, shimulakuralakhwo khandi ta; okhuba likhuwa liomundu yesi lilaba omusiiko kukwe; okhuba mwashiamiye amakhuwa kaNyasaye oubeetsangaho mwoyo, akOMWAMI omwene mahe ouli Nyasaye weefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka olareeba omunabii; mbu OMWAMI akhukalusiye arie? Kata mbu OMWAMI aboolile arie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.37",
